===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|pok}}, from {{inh|en|ang|poc}}, {{m|ang|pocc|t=pock; pustule; ulcer}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*pukkaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*pukkǭ|t=pock; swelling}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bew-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*bʰew-|t=to blow; swell}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|pok|t=pock}}, {{cog|nds|Pocke|t=pock}}, {{cog|de|Pocke|t=pock}}.

